  message: "DONE: merged in PR #1383. The Go DDG walks each outermost function literal of a package-level var_spec under the analyzer's own variable id at its exact span (LanguageDdgSpec bound_bodies_for / bound_anchor_kinds); a binding with several literals, a call outside them, or no call node types forfeits refutation. Behavioural evidence: the no-leak body bound to a var or a cobra Run: field went from VIOLATED (structural) to no evidence, matching the declaration; the leaking variant reads ddg/confirmed (test_no_leak_is_no_finding_whatever_the_binding, test_a_real_leak_is_confirmed_by_the_walk). beads: 26 of 27 :variable-source situations now carry a DDG verdict (1 confirmed, 2 ddg_mixed, 23 not-attempted with reasons), no finding removed, pair total 2080 unchanged. No recorded failing test run (cancelled in queue; failure shown by live repro + arm A). NOT asserted: file-scope code walked (WI-nilir).\nFull report (closure evidence, corpus tables, residual list): /home/jgstern_agent/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/decontend/run_09302026/rovun.md"  # 2bab
